title: "robot-motion-robustness"
version: "0.1.0"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Zirui
    family-names: Guo
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-2366-5218"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  This reproducibility software package supports the empirical evaluation of
  frozen cuRobo-generated Franka Panda manipulator trajectories under
  controlled environment perturbations, with independent sampled-state
  collision validation using Isaac Sim and PhysX.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - motion planning
  - collision checking
  - trajectory robustness
  - cuRobo
  - Isaac Sim
  - PhysX
  - Franka Panda
  - reproducibility
repository-code: "https://github.com/Astok-4/robot-motion-robustness"
